  loopn 2 uint64 t streamid   0 read   wt- readstreamdata streamid write   wt- writestreamdata  
      streamid nullptr reset   wt- resetstream streamid   0 ss   wt- stopsending streamid   0 await   wt- awaitwritable streamid   
 
  expect read haserror      write haserror      reset haserror      
              ss haserror      await haserror     
 
    
