co test f httpstreamtransport  writebackpressure    
   
 
  folly  iobufqueue egress folly  iobufqueue  cachechainlength     
    
  egress append makebuf 65 535    
  folly  coro  transport  writeinfo info writeres   co withexecutor  evb  
                                  transport- write egress  
                                                   std  chrono  milliseconds 0   
                                                   folly  writeflags  none  
                                                    info   
                       startinlineunsafe    
  expect writeres isready     
  expect eq info byteswritten  65 535   
 
    
  egress append makebuf 100    
  writeres   
      co withexecutor  evb  transport- write egress   startinlineunsafe    
  expect writeres isready     
 
    
  co await egresssource- readbodyevent    
    
  evb looponce    
  expect writeres isready     
 
    
  expect call ingresssource  stopreading      
  transport- closewithreset ev   co await co awaittry egresssource- readbodyevent     
  expect ev hasexception     
  
 
